    "updated_at": "2024-06-24T07:41:58Z",
    "body": "It feels like https://github.com/whatwg/infra/issues/396 might be related here, although I'm not sure it's exactly the same thing.\r\n\r\nHow [Chromium's code does it](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/modules/scheduler/dom_timer.cc;l=125-137;drc=90cac1911508d3d682a67c97aa62483eb712f69a) is it keeps a \"next timer ID\" variable. That seems relatively simple and still allows us to clear the map entries. It also reduces implementation-defined behavior.",
